        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>DWD-HPULL24-613, 24\" Contemporary Stainless Steel Door Pull in Oil Rubbed Bronze</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 2 Foot Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pull is a Doorware.com exclusive. The modern design is accentuated by modern materials; this 24 inch door pull is made of stainless steel tubing with a very rich oil rubbed bronze powder-coat. The DWD-HPULL24-613 is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting (just make sure you order 2 pulls if you choose this option) for use on wood, fiberglass, metal, or glass doors. This 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is beautiful enough for use in any home, but it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-HPULL24-Specifications.gif?v=1704354532\" width=\"493\" height=\"137\" border=\"0\" alt=\"DWD-HPULL24-613 Dimensions\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in other lengths: <a href=\"/products/36-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-door-pull-dwd-hpull36-613\"><b>36\" Door Pull</b></a>, <a href=\"/products/48-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull48-613\"><b>48\" Door Pull</b></a> or <a href=\"/products/60-inch-oil-rubbed-bronze-ladder-pull-dwd-hpull60-613\"><b>60\" Door Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DWD HPULL24-613 Contemporary Door Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Oil Rubbed Bronze</b></li> \r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Total Height: 24\" (610 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\" (355 mm) </li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/8\" (80 mm)</li>\r\n<li>Handle Diameter: 1-1/4\" (32 mm) Round</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant Door Hardware</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back to Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/how-to-mount-and-install-door-pulls\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/pull-mounting-hardware.gif?v=1774579796\" width=\"600\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Pull Mounting Hardware\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "2 Foot Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pull, DWD-HPULL24-613",
                "description": "DWD-HPULL24-613, 2 Foot Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pull - The 2 Foot Oil Rubbed Bronze Ladder Pull is a Doorware.com exclusive. The modern design is accentuated by modern materials; this 24 inch door pull is made of stainless steel tubing with a very rich oil rubbed bronze powder-coat. The DWD-HPULL24-613 is available with thru-bolt mounting, surface mounting, or back-to-back mounting (just make sure you order 2 pulls if you choose this option) for use on wood, fiberglass, metal or glass doors. This 24 Inch Oil Rubbed Bronze Door Pull is beautiful enough for use in any home, but it is tough enough for use in commercial settings too. \r\n",
